ing a second parameter according to chatgpt 5.1) which may have or not contributed to this skew in behaviour. See for details [KI#78](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs_And_Appendixes/README_Known_Issues_In_Base_AdvCiv_Civ4.md#78---tremendously-improved-trade-techs-preferentially-with-our-vassals-or-master-synergises-with-the-no-overlap-previous-master-vassals-tweak--bugfix-missing-second-parameter-now-ai_contactrollcontact_trade_tech-rcontactprobmult-according-to-chatgpt-51). (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5138+) **Update:** Extend the same extra trade bias to **sibling vassal↔vassal** trades. In autoplay (Ewuare with two vassals at T250), this produced broadly similar outcomes to the master–vassal–only version, which is acceptable since the change only increases trade chances (doesn’t remove any) and is therefore less likely to be harmful.
